{"id":"08c88154570b3baf","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-shortest-description-information.md","title":"Information in a Shortest Description","display":"thm-shortest-description-information — Information in a Shortest Description","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-shortest-description-information","aliases":["43-thm-shortest-description-information"],"display":"thm-shortest-description-information — Information in a Shortest Description","depends_on":["[[43-df-shortest-description]]","[[43-df-condkolm]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemmas 6.2.1 and 6.13.1","source_printed_pages":"91; 113","source_pdf_pages":"111; 133","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-shortest-description-information"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-shortest-description-information</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shortest-description-information — Information in a Shortest Description"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f3e60136c4c0887\" href=\"?note=6f3e60136c4c0887\" title=\"43-df-shortest-description\">43-df-shortest-description</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemmas 6.2.1 and 6.13.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"91; 113"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"111; 133"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*\">\\(\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6f3e60136c4c0887\" href=\"?note=6f3e60136c4c0887\" title=\"43-df-shortest-description\">43-df-shortest-description</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,K\">\\(C,K\\)</span> 及其条件版本按各定义采用固定机器。自然数条件输出按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|K(\\sigma^*\\mid\\sigma)-K(\\operatorname{bin}(K(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|K(\\sigma^*\\mid\\sigma)-K(\\operatorname{bin}(K(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C(\\sigma_C^*\\mid\\sigma)-C(\\operatorname{bin}(C(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C(\\sigma_C^*\\mid\\sigma)-C(\\operatorname{bin}(C(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最短描述长度给出复杂度；给定输出和复杂度，可以有效搜索最先出现的该长度程序。规范星号选择在此是实质条件。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemmas 6.2.1 and 6.13.1；印刷页 91; 113，PDF 页 111; 133。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-shortest-description","status":"resolved","id":"6f3e60136c4c0887","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-shortest-description]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condkolm","status":"resolved","id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-shortest-description","status":"resolved","id":"6f3e60136c4c0887","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*$ 见 [[43-df-shortest-description]]；$C,K$ 及其条件版本按各定义采用固定机器。自然数条件输出按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*$ 见 [[43-df-shortest-description]]；$C,K$ 及其条件版本按各定义采用固定机器。自然数条件输出按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|K(\\sigma^*\\mid\\sigma)-K(\\operatorname{bin}(K(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c,","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C(\\sigma_C^*\\mid\\sigma)-C(\\operatorname{bin}(C(\\sigma))\\mid\\sigma)|\\le c.","display":true}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-shortest-description-information]] — Information in a Shortest Description"}],"outgoing":["6f3e60136c4c0887","1d74032e32e804fb","e79ea45002ccf795","e039afac1517f3d7"]}